#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_4116b948"
msgid "Tu veux reprendre ta vie en main mais ça passe aussi par certaines relations que tu as peut-être un trop négligées ces dernières années."
msgstr "네가 인생의 주도권을 되찾고 싶은 건 알아, 하지만 그건 최근 몇 년간 너무 소홀히 했던 관계들도 함께 포함되는 문제야."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_520c88a3"
msgid "Peut-être..."
msgstr "어쩌면..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_309d4f2b"
