#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_36956dde"
msgid "Les rares souvenirs que j'ai encore d'elle remontent à ma vie d'avant, un peu avant le drame..."
msgstr "내가 그녀에 대해 간직하고 있는 몇 안 되는 기억은 비극이 닥치기 바로 직전, 내 옛 삶까지 거슬러 올라가."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_cc697f99"
msgid "Elle avait quitté la maison après que {{yasuka.n}} ait pris ma défense."
msgstr "그녀는 {{yasuka.n}}가 나를 변호해 준 후 집을 떠났다."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_ccdebd01"
msgid "Après avoir passé des semaines à traîner avec les thugs et autres fréquentations bien pires..."
msgstr "수주일 동안 폭력배나 그보다 훨씬 더 나쁜 다른 지인들과 어울려 다닌 후에..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_efd35198"
msgid "{{noriko.n}} avait été retrouvé morte gisant dans le canal, mais les choses ne semblent pas prendre cette tournure cette fois-ci."
msgstr "{{noriko.n}}는 운하에 쓰러져 시체로 발견됐었지만, 이번엔 그렇게 되지 않을 것 같아."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_63c16f36"
msgid "Avant ça... À quel moment j'ai connu {{noriko.n}} d'ailleurs ?"
msgstr "그 전에... 내가 {{noriko.n}}를 처음 만난 게 언제였지?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_3f8d541f"
msgid "Je crois que c'est quand mon père m'a laissé chez {{yasuka.n}} pour ne plus jamais revenir."
msgstr "아버지가 나를 {{yasuka.n}}에게 맡기고 다시는 돌아오지 않았을 때부터였던 것 같아."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_93f8a8f7"
msgid "Je devais avoir quoi... 7 ou 8 ans."
msgstr "그때 나는... 일곱이나 여덟 살이었던 것 같아."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_fffb2ccc"
msgid "Tout ça est encore flou."
msgstr "그 모든 시간이 아직도 흐릿할 뿐이야."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_df50e201"
msgid "Alors ?"
