#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_1e36043d"
msgid "À vos ordres !"
msgstr "원하시는 대로요!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_8cf365c8"
msgid "Alors ? Vu ta tête, j'ai pas l'impression que ça se soit bien passé."
