#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_5851f82e"
msgid "Non je...[w] une minute maintenant que tu me le dis..."
