#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_f5709729"
msgid "Plus vite tu résoudras cette histoire avec {{noriko.n}}..."
msgstr "{{noriko.n}}와의 이 문제를 빨리 해결할수록..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_5b1bb6e5"
