#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy,blush`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_1d4ad3b3"
msgid "Et ne tarde pas trop car moi aussi j'ai besoin de ma dose quotidienne de {{saito.n}}."
msgstr "그리고 너무 오래 걸리지 마, 나도 매일 {{saito.n}}가 필요하니까."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_c6ce6998"
