#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_b01a8d00"
msgid "Peut-être que {{yasuka.n}} en saura plus que moi à ce sujet ?"
msgstr "아마 {{yasuka.n}}가 나보다 이거에 대해 더 많이 알지 않을까?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_137ddb9e"
msgid "Je devrais faire part de ce que j'ai appris à {{asami.n}}, elle aura peut-être une idée ou deux."
msgstr "내가 알아낸 내용을 {{asami.n}}에게도 알려줘야겠어. 그녀도 좋은 아이디어가 있을지 모르니까."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_0670808a"
