#. Character:`akira`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_bd125fec"
msgid "Alors cet ici que dort ce déchet..."
msgstr "그래, 이 쓰레기 같은 놈이 자는 곳이 여기였나..."

#. Character:`akira` | Attributes:`arrogant`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_4dee3107"
msgid "Rien que de voir ça j'ai déja un million d'idées sur comment je pourrais faire de sa vie un enfer."
msgstr "이것만 봐도 그놈 인생을 지옥으로 만들어버릴 방법이 수백 가지는 넘게 떠오르네."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_136e4665"
msgid "Ne touche à rien ! Je n'ai pas envie d'avoir des problèmes."
