#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_7cd7a7ef"
msgid "Mais c'est justement ça qui est bien, tu n'auras plus de problèmes dorénavant."
msgstr "하지만 그게 좋은 점이잖아. 앞으로는 더 이상 문제가 없을 거야."

#. Character:`akira`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_room_6397bb0c"
