msgctxt "talk_kimochi_2868bdf3"
msgid "[font_size=14]Tu ne ferais pas ça quand même ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]그러지 않으시겠죠?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_4d82a4e6"
msgid "Ça dépend si tu ouvres la porte ou pas."
msgstr "그건 네가 이 문을 열지 안 열지에 달렸어."

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_e8dc186b"
msgid "[font_size=14]C'est bon, tu as gagné, je sors.[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]알았어, 네가 이겼어. 나갈게.[/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_0ebca8a2"
msgid "Sinon, tu as un nom ? J'aimerais pouvoir t'appeler autrement que \"le stalker\" ou \"le pervers\"."
msgstr "어쨌든 이름이 있나요? 스토커나 변태라고 부르는 것보다는 다른 이름으로 불렀으면 좋겠어요."

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_03927374"
msgid "{{kimochi.n}}."
msgstr "{{kimochi.n}}."

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_7cc65d9c"
msgid "{{kimochi.n}} Warui."
msgstr "{{kimochi.n}} 미안."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_3ea7f0e7"
msgid "Mais..."
msgstr "하지만..."

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`disgusted`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_b1a2f02d"
msgid "Oui, je sais, mes parents qui ne me désiraient pas ont eu l'idée de me donner ce nom."
msgstr "응, 알고 있어. 내 부모님은 나를 원하지 않아서 그 이름을 앙갚음으로 지어준 거야."

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_4951233c"
msgid "Bref, on s'en bat les couilles, tu as trouvé une solution à notre problème ?"
msgstr "어쨌든 누가 신경 쓰나. 우리 문제 해결 방법 찾았어?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_141ef3dd"
msgid "Dis-moi plutôt de quoi tu soupçonnes {{minato.n}} ?"
msgstr "{{minato.n}}한테 왜 의심이 드는지 이유를 말해주지 않을래?"

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_c401bf33"
msgid "Ça veut dire que tu me crois ?"
msgstr "그럼 나를 믿어주는 거야?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_6d132d89"
msgid "Oui... J'ai eu un aperçu de son vrai visage et ce que j'ai vu ne m'a pas plus."
msgstr "응... 그의 본색을 살짝 엿봤는데, 별로 마음에 들지 않았어."

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_c9e3694d"
msgid "Dis-moi tout !"
msgstr "전부 다 말해줘!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_7274a40f"
msgid "Il m'a juste avoué avoir fait semblant de se faire passer pour mon meilleur ami pour être aux premières loges lorsque je me faisais harceler."
msgstr "그는 그저 내가 괴롭힘 당하는 걸 제일 잘 볼 수 있으려고 내 최고의 친구인 척했었다고 방금 인정했어."

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_e0fea42f"
msgid "Et après, on dit que c'est moi le pervers..."
msgstr "그리고 사람들은 나를 변태라고 부르지..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_8d6e304d"
msgid "J'ai eu l'impression de parler à un véritable psychopathe."
msgstr "그 사람이 진짜 사이코인 것 같아."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_4b4ac996"
msgid "J'en ai eu des frissons."
msgstr "소름이 끼쳐."

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`think`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_7c41b277"
msgid "C'est une réaction normale."
msgstr "정상적인 반응이야."

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_66c07b2a"
msgid "Notre cerveau, qui est une merveille d'ingénierie biologique, nous avertit d'un danger imminent ou de quelque chose qui pourrait menacer notre vie."
msgstr "진정한 생명공학의 기적인 우리 인간의 뇌는 임박한 위험과 생명을 위협할 수 있는 것들을 우리에게 경고해 줍니다."

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`frustrated`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_74a27bb6"
msgid "J'ai ce sentiment-là depuis que j'ai croisé son regard la première fois, c'était il y a quelques années."
msgstr "그와 처음 눈이 마주쳤을 때부터 그런 느낌이 들었어. 그게 벌써 몇 년 전이네."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_e027a8b4"
msgid "Que crois-tu qu'il fasse subir à sa petite sœur ?"
msgstr "그가 자기 여동생에게 무슨 짓을 할 거라고 생각해?"

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_14d773c1"
msgid "...Es-tu sûr de vouloir l'entendre ?"
msgstr "..정말 그 질문에 대한 답을 듣고 싶은 거야?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_d50c87f5"
msgid "Je dois savoir."
msgstr "알아야 해."

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_c9df85d4"
msgid "Je ne sais pas grand-chose, car je n'ai jamais pu m'approcher assez."
msgstr "가까이 가볼 수조차 없었어서 그리 많이 알지 못해."

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_00977ff0"
msgid "Mais tous les weekends, le sous-sol de leur maison est allumé et il y a une grosse berline garée juste à côté."
msgstr "하지만 매 주말마다 그들의 지하실 불이 켜져 있고, 바로 밖에 대형 세단이 주차되어 있거든."

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_bbb32214"
msgid "J'ai fait des recherches afin de savoir à qui appartient la plaque et il s'avère qu'il s'agit de la voiture d'un clan de yakuza local."
msgstr "그 차가 누구 것인지 알아보기 위해 조사를 했어. 알고 보니 그 지역 야쿠자 조직의 소유였더라고."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_b1d1f111"
msgid "Putain, c'est quoi le nom du clan ?"
msgstr "젠장. 그 패거리 이름이 뭐지?"

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`think`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_1607a7f3"
msgid "Lune sanglante."
msgstr "블러디 문."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_ed9864f8"
msgid "Merde."
msgstr "씨발."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_a5418e10"
msgid "Je ne pensais pas entendre ce nom aussi vite."
msgstr "그 이름을 이렇게 빨리 듣게 될 줄은 몰랐어."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_28248520"
msgid "Si {{minato.n}} est en lien avec ce clan, alors {{chiaki.n}} et {{natsume.n}} sont en danger de mort."
msgstr "만약 {{minato.n}}이 그 조직과 연루되어 있다면, {{chiaki.n}}과 {{natsume.n}}의 목숨이 위험하다는 걸 장담할 수 있어."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_0321e5fc"
msgid "On n'a jamais su comment tout avait commencé, mais à la base Lune sanglante était un clan mineur."
msgstr "어떻게 시작됐는지 우리는 전혀 알지 못했지만, 블러디 문은 처음에는 그저 작은 클랜에 불과했어."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_c9c453ac"
msgid "Mais des années plus tard, quand la vérité a éclaté, il s'est avéré qu'ils avaient gangréné absolument toutes les institutions de l'État, ils étaient intouchables."
msgstr "몇 년 후 진실이 밝혀졌을 때, 그들이 모든 국가 기관을 부패시켜 버렸던 것 같았어. 절대 건드릴 수 없는 존재였지."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_6a82d9ed"
msgid "Prostitution, trafic d'organe, esclavage, drogue et ce n'était que le haut de l'iceberg."
msgstr "매춘, 장기 밀매, 노예 매매, 마약... 그건 빙산의 일각에 불과했어."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_a409ae00"
msgid "La police ne faisait rien, elle était de toute façon contrôlée par le clan."
msgstr "경찰은 아무 조치도 취하지 않았어. 그들 역시 클랜의 통제 하에 있었거든."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_5f2d6609"
msgid "{{kimochi.n}}, c'est la merde !"
msgstr "이건 재앙이야, {{kimochi.n}}!"

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_818da754"
msgid "Je sais que parler de yakuza ça impressionne, mais il s'agit d'un petit clan mineur."
msgstr "야쿠자 이야기를 하면 불편할 수 있다는 거 알아, 하지만 그들은 아주 작은 패거리일 뿐이야."

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_f70b7761"
msgid "Pas de quoi fouetter un chat. Tu sais de nos jours à part faire des bubble tea, les yakusas ne font plus grand-chose."
msgstr "별거 아니야. 요즘 야쿠자는 버블티 만드는 것 외에는 별로 하는 일 없다는 거 알잖아?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_05b2aed3"
msgid "Fais-moi confiance là-dessus, ceux-là sont extrêmement dangereux."
msgstr "날 믿어, 이 놈들은 정말 위험해."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_0348b611"
msgid "À tout hasard, as-tu déjà contacté la police ou les services sociaux ?"
msgstr "혹시 경찰이나 사회복지 서비스에 전화했어?"

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_999ccea8"
msgid "Oui..."
msgstr "네..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_4280a9bf"
msgid "Laisse-moi deviner, ils ont voulu te mettre en garde à vue pour en savoir plus sur toi ?"
msgstr "내가 맞춰보자, 그들이 너를 구금해서 '너에 대해 더 알아보려고' 했던 거지?"

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`frustrated`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_1e6a3fe5"
msgid "CO- Comment tu as su ?"
msgstr "호, 어떻게 알았어?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_7a694400"
msgid "Merde, ils sont déjà bien implantés dans la ville."
msgstr "젠장, 벌써 마을에 뿌리 깊게 자리 잡고 있잖아."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_b01c1755"
msgid "Il va falloir être prudent à présent... Dis-toi que nos vies sont menacées."
msgstr "지금부터 조심해야 해... 내가 말해주잖아, 우리 목숨이 위험해."

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_2e942a4e"
msgid "Quoi ? À ce point ? Tu as l'air d'en savoir plus que moi."
msgstr "뭐? 정말? 나보다 훨씬 많이 아는 것 같네."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_97ba2862"
msgid "Je te garantis que je te dirai tout le moment venu, mais là, si on veut pouvoir sortir {{chiaki.n}} et {{natsume.n}} de ce merdier, il va nous falloir plus qu'un simple plan."
msgstr "장담할게요, 때가 되면 전부 말해드릴 거예요. 하지만 지금 당장 {{chiaki.n}}와 {{natsume.n}}를 위험에서 구하려면 단순한 계획만으로는 부족해요."

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_67ef1164"
msgid "{{natsume.n}} ? C'est qui ça ?"
msgstr "{{natsume.n}}? 그게 누구야?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_fd1bfa4d"
msgid "La petite amie de {{minato.n}}."
msgstr "{{minato.n}}의 여자친구예요."

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`think`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_3111da4d"
msgid "Mais elle est de quel côté ? Elle est au courant de ce qui se passe ?"
msgstr "그녀가 어느 편을 들 거라고 생각해? 지금 상황을 알고 있을까?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_7e3e0efb"
msgid "Je n'en sais rien, c'est ce que je vais essayer de découvrir."
msgstr "모르지만 알아보려고 노력할게요."

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_26f65224"
msgid "On ne peut pas aller voir la police tous les deux ?"
msgstr "우리 둘 다 경찰에 가면 어떨까?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_766c6017"
msgid "La police n'interviendra pas, il y a des membres du clan dans la police."
msgstr "경찰은 우릴 도와주지 않을 거야. 경찰 조직에 클랜 소속원이 있거든."

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_6e750445"
msgid "Mais... Comment on va faire ?"
msgstr "그럼... 우리 뭘 해야 하지?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_b44ca111"
msgid "Il va falloir se préparer comme jamais."
msgstr "우리는 훈련이 필요해. 그 어느 때보다도 훨씬 더."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_541a6a73"
msgid "Trouver des renforts prêts à mettre leur vie en jeu."
msgstr "우리를 돕기 위해 목숨을 걸 동료들을 더 찾아야 해."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_722c8999"
msgid "Est-ce que tu es prêt pour ça ?"
msgstr "준비됐어?"

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_58596d72"
msgid "Si je tourne le dos à une petite fille en détresse, je ne serais plus digne d'être considéré comme un homme."
msgstr "위험에 처한 여자를 외면하면 더 이상 남자로 인정받을 자격도 없어."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_16f5df63"
msgid "Bien parlé."
msgstr "잘 말했어."

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_f845be84"
msgid "Je vais continuer de chercher des informations de mon côté, je te tiens informé dès que j'en apprendrai plus."
msgstr "계속 정보를 찾아보고, 더 알게 되는 대로 즉시 알려드릴게요."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_c9353cf6"
msgid "Ça marche !"
msgstr "됐다!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_1f961e4c"
msgid "Bon, j'ai un allié de plus et un nouvel ennemi colossal qui vient d'apparaitre."
msgstr "음, 하나 더 아군이 생겼고, 방금 거대한 새로운 적이 하나 나타났나 보네."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_b5cdc75f"
msgid "Et le fait de savoir que {{minato.n}} est lié à Lune sanglante..."
msgstr "게다가 {{minato.n}}이 블러디 문과 연관되어 있다는 걸 알고 있으니..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "talk_kimochi_14bde82e"
msgid "Est bien plus flippant que tout ce que j'aurais pu imaginer."
msgstr "..내가 상상했던 그 어떤 것보다 훨씬 무섭다."

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
msgctxt "te6fccb3b09"
msgid "[next]"
msgstr "[next]"

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "kimochi_password_1ab316a6"
msgid "[font_size=14]Bien que je sois d'accord avec cette citation hautement philosophique.[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]그 아주 철학적인 명언에는 동의하지만...[/font_size]"

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_kimochi_interior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "kimochi_password_26b65d60"
msgid "[font_size=14]Ce n'est pas le bon mot de passe.[/font_size]"
