#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_ddac5171"
msgid "Trouve plutôt quelqu'un qui t'aimera pour toi."
msgstr "너를 있는 그대로 사랑해 줄 사람을 찾아보는 게 좋을 거야."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_293d6ff6"
msgid "Tu es plutôt mignonne, je suis certain que tu trouveras quelqu'un d'autre bien assez tôt."
msgstr "너 꽤 귀여우니까, 곧 다른 사람을 만날 수 있을 거야."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_77203b5b"
msgid "Tu le penses vraiment ?"
msgstr "정말 그렇게 생각해?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_520f791b"
msgid "Sans aucun doute."
msgstr "의심할 여지가 없어."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_729dfc8d"
msgid "Merci... {{saito.n}}, j'étais vraiment sur le point de faire une bêtise."
msgstr "고마워… {{saito.n}}, 정말 큰 실수를 할 뻔했어."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_3f0b951d"
msgid "Je te le fais pas dire."
msgstr "네가 말해봐."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_d3ef9877"
msgid "Tu aurais pu dire oui et profiter de moi..."
msgstr "그냥 받아들여서 나를 이용했을 수도 있었는데…"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_fb07b9da"
msgid "J'aurais pu en effet..."
msgstr "과연 그랬을 수도 있었겠지..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_35bb1c63"
msgid "Mais tu ne l'as pas fait."
msgstr "하지만 너는 안 했잖아."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_cb142e49"
msgid "Dis...[w] Tu pensais vraiment ce que tu as demandé quand tu as dit que je te plaisais et que tu voulais sortir avec moi ?"
msgstr "있잖아… [w] 나한테 관심 있다고 사귀고 싶다고 했던 거, 정말 진심이었어?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_f280d4b0"
msgid "Ou c'était juste pour te renseigner ?"
