#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_8e8e2877"
msgid "Au final, les choses ne changent pas."
msgstr "결국 아무것도 변하지 않았어."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_f79342a7"
msgid "Même si je me donne du mal."
