#. Character:`natsume` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_831bc125"
msgid "...Tu sais à quel point je déteste qu'on me mente ?"
msgstr "..내가 거짓말당하는 거 얼마나 싫어하는지 알아?"

#. Character:`natsume`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_294763de"
msgid "Je vais répondre à ta place[w] tu n'en sais rien."
msgstr "내가 대신 답해줄게.[w] 그런 거 너는 모르잖아."

#. Character:`natsume`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_03a6fdc7"
msgid "Mais ce que je déteste par-dessus tout."
