#. Character:`natsume`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_3513cc85"
msgid "Je hais les menteurs, je hais les mensonges, je hais tous ces faux semblants."
msgstr "거짓말쟁이도 싫고, 거짓말도 싫고, 모든 허식도 다 싫어."

#. Character:`natsume`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_d9b5404a"
msgid "Ça fait ressortir tout ce qu'il y a de plus mauvais en nous, le dégout, la lâcheté, la honte..."
msgstr "그건 우리 안에 있는 최악의 감정을 꺼내게 해: 혐오, 비겁함, 수치심..."

#. Character:`natsume`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_828a63e1"
msgid "{{saito.n}}, j'ai envie de croire que tu vaux mieux que ça."
msgstr "{{saito.n}}, 나는 네가 이보다 나을 거라고 믿고 싶어."

#. Character:`natsume`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_2e82f929"
msgid "Parle ! Dis-moi ce qui te tracasse !"
msgstr "말해! 지금 무슨 일이 벌어진 건지 전부 말하라고!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_03775ec8_3"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`natsume`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
msgctxt "t736c58adcb"
msgid "[next]"
msgstr "[next]"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_a28828c7"
msgid "{{saito.n}} raconta toute l'histoire à {{natsume.n}}."
