msgstr "전부 다 말하라고."

#. Character:`natsume`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_b5aef86e"
msgid "Mais qu'elle bande de sous-merde ces trois-là !"
msgstr "그 세 명은 진짜 개자식들 뿐이야!"

#. Character:`natsume`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_89fc2f43"
msgid "Ah, j'y crois pas."
msgstr "아, 믿을 수가 없네."

#. Character:`natsume` | Attributes:`-angry`
