#. Character:`natsume`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "home_player_exterior_94c0e93c"
msgid "Nous livrer aux trois thugs ou leur donner ta famille ?"
msgstr "그 세 명의 폭력배에게 항복할 거야, 아니면 가족을 내줄 거야?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_exterior.dialogue
#, fuzzy
