#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/park.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "menu_macumba_85e0aca3"
msgid "{{asami.n}} avait raison, cet entrainement est vraiment trop étrange."
msgstr "{{asami.n}} 말이 맞았어. 그 훈련은 정말로 너무 이상해."

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/park.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "menu_macumba_96e02e04"
