#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/park.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "menu_macumba_ed6623a0"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`macumba`
#: game/story/park.dialogue
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "menu_macumba_ed7887a9"
